    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"step off the stage entirely\"... that's a heavy thing to say. almost like you're saying it's okay to just stop being part of it. because when i look at people, i just see nothing. i see people chasing things that don't matter. i feel like i've seen too much to ever fit back in. like i'm already gone, i just haven't realized it yet.",
